    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5c0b97ee-8e01-567b-bd48-c6892cdfcfdb" activityNameId="524b2040-daec-5028-b90e-6fde551afd9b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Window frame, plastic (PVC), U=1.6 W/m2K, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Window frame, plastic (PVC), U=1.6 W/m2K, at plant
This dataset describes all the processes and material inputs needed to produce a plastic window frame with 1 m2 visible area. 1 m2 of visible plastic window frame weighs 94.5 kg.;
UUID: 0b88140b-07ed-30d2-b5a5-fb1be3082794
Included processes are injection moulding and extrusion of PVC, section bar rolling for steel fittings, section bar extrusion for aluminium parts, all the road transport at different production phases and the process heat waste. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The dataset describes highly automated technology processes in window frame manufacturing.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company documentation, measurements 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0b88140b-07ed-30d2-b5a5-fb1be3082794.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
